g. Anak korban penculikan, penjualan dan/atau perdagangan orang;

Anak korban Kekerasan fisik dan/atau psikis;

Anak korban kejahatan seksual;
k. Anak korban jaringan terorisme;

Anak Penyandang Disabilitas;

Anak korban perlakuan salah dan penelantaran;

Anak dengan perilaku sosial menyimpang; dan Anak yang menjadi korban stigmatisasi dari pelabelan terkait dengan kondisi Orang Tuanya.

translated_text:
Article 167

Special Protection for Children as referred to in Article 166 letter is provided to: Children in emergency situations;
a. Children in conflict with the law;

Children from minority and isolated groups;
c. Children who are exploited economically and/or sexually;

Children who are victims of narcotics, alcohol, psychotropic, and other addictive substance abuse and/or involved in their production/distribution;

Children who are victims of pornography;
f. Children with HIV/AIDS;
g. Children who are victims of kidnapping, sale and/or trafficking in persons;

Children who are victims of physical and/or psychological Violence;

Children who are victims of sexual crimes;
k. Children who are victims of terrorism networks;

Children with Disabilities;

Children who are victims of abuse and neglect;

Children with deviant social behavior; and Children who are victims of stigmatization from labeling related to their Parents' condition.

text:
Pasal 168

Perlindungan Khusus bagi Anak sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 167 dilakukan melalui upaya: penanganan yang cepat;
a. pengobatan;

rehabilitasi secara fisik;

rehabilitasi psikis;

rehabilitasi sosial;

pencegahan penyakit dan gangguan kesehatan lainnya;
f. pendampingan psikososial pada saat pengobatan sampalig. pemulihan;

pemberian bantuan sosial bagi Anak yang berasal dari Keluarga tidak mampu; dan pemberian perlindungan dan pendampingan pada setiap proses peradilan.

translated_text:
Article 168

