a. medical treatment;

physical rehabilitation;

psychological rehabilitation;

social rehabilitation;

prevention of disease and other health disorders;
f. psychosocial assistance during treatment untilg. recovery;

provision of social assistance for Children from underprivileged Families; and provision of protection and assistance in every judicial process.

text:
